  message: "Dogfooding re-confirmed (blinded severity 3/5): limits.partial_results_reason is emitted as an empty string while analysis_incomplete:false, contradicting spec §960 ('present only when analysis_incomplete: true'). A consumer testing `'partial_results_reason' in limits` to detect incompleteness gets a false positive. Same conditional-emit fix. Cross-ref WI-zafid (broader completeness-signal channel). [dogfood]"  # 8bea
